WEBVTT

00:36:57.782 --> 00:37:00.416
can set you up to shape the future.

00:37:00.440 --> 00:37:03.059
Siri: But I'm more agile
than you'll ever be, Adam.

00:37:03.083 --> 00:37:04.345
Ha ha ha.

00:37:04.369 --> 00:37:10.100
(Music)

00:37:10.124 --> 00:37:11.932
AG: Next time on WorkLife.

00:37:11.956 --> 00:37:17.733
Dave Fano: I think people are very capable
of convincing themselves

00:37:17.757 --> 00:37:22.615
that actions that most
would recognize as taking

00:37:22.639 --> 00:37:25.066
are in the service of giving.

00:37:25.090 --> 00:37:26.436
AG: A special bonus episode

00:37:26.460 --> 00:37:29.795
that explores the culture
at one of the great success, and failure,

00:37:29.819 --> 00:37:31.811
stories of our time, WeWork.